    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esiimbo eya Aruni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Musa ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Boolela babaandu ba Isiraeli bakhuelesie chisiimbo likhumi na chibili, buli ndala khukhwama khu buli omwimeelesi owe luuya lwa Isiraeli. Andika lisina lia buli mundu khu siimbo yewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne andika lisina lia Aruni khu siimbo eye Balawi. Echa khubao esiimbo ndala khu buli omwimeelesi owe luuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ochiile mwiiema lie kumuse mala ochire ebweeni we Lisanduku lie ndakaano, niio ese nakaananilanga ne nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne esiimbo eyo mundu niye ndobore echa khu sisina. Khwako nja khumalao khukhweng'ulung'unya khwe Baisiraeli khuno khwiwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa alomaloma ne Baisiraeli mala babemeelesi babwe boosi bamuelesia chisiimbo, ndala khukhwama mu buli nju choosi likhumi na chibili. Ne esiimbo eya Aruni yosi yabamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala Musa ara chisiimbo choosi mwiiema lie kumuse ebweeni we lisanduku lie ndakaano eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
